if {mask_default} == true:
	[signal arg="intro_end"]
	[end_timeline]
join Mazapégul (idle_hat) right
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Hey you, yes you!
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Yep, i am talking to you, and only you!
Mazapégul (idle_hat): No, don't turn around!
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Yes! I am talking to you!
Mazapégul (idle_hat): When a magic monkey-cat-whatever talks to you, do not pretend to not hear him!
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Just a friendly advice, you know.
Player: Wh-who are you? Or better, WHAT are you?
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Are you dense?
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Or worse, are you PATACCA?
Mazapégul (idle_hat): I already told you, i am a magic monkey-cat.
Player: Honestly that only creates more questions...
Mazapégul (idle_hat): WHATEVER!
Mazapégul (idle_hat): I am, oh boy indeed i am, the gRRRRRRRRReat Mazapégul!
Player: Isn't that just a fairy from legends?
Player: My grandma told me the Mazapégul is always up to mischief.
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Dear boy, i'd tip my hat to you if it wasn't stuck to my head on the PNG.
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Yes!
Mazapégul (idle_hat): I am always up to something, but it's all in good fun mind you!
Mazapégul (idle_hat): This one time, however, i think we share a common goal.
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Or maybe, a common enemy, right?
Player: ...What do you mean?
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Oh don't be alarmed, when you're ancient, wise, beautiful, smart...
Player: He's been listing adjective for like fifteen minutes...
Mazapégul (idle_hat): ...and modest like me, you know a thing or two, you go around.
Mazapégul (idle_hat): SO, entertain me.
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Did SHE took something from you?
Player: She?
Mazapégul (idle_hat): You'll learn soon enough, boy.
Player: ...Yes.
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Ha-ha!
Mazapégul (idle_hat): Just as i thought!
Mazapégul (idle_hat): My dear boy, you'll learn soon enought who is this "she" i am rambling about.
Mazapégul (idle_hat): But there is one itty bitty small problem\: she, in turn, cannot know who you are.
Mazapégul (idle): Here, take these.
set {mask_default} = true
[signal arg="mazapegul"]
join berretto center
label Maschera1
- Take the mask
	leave berretto
	[signal arg="intro_end"]
	Mazapégul (idle): This mask shall hide your identity, for the time being.
	Mazapégul (idle): I cannot linger here anymore, lest she finds me.
	Mazapégul (idle): We shall see each other again soon!
	Mazapégul (idle): Do not, i repeat...
	Mazapégul (idle): DO-NOT! Take off your mask in here, it's not safe.
	Mazapégul (idle): Ciao
- Refuse equipment from weird magic monkey-cat.
	Mazapégul (idle): Do not be silly, you NEED this mask, like, really really need it!
	jump Maschera1